{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "tonefx",
 "version": "4.3b",
 "title": "Tone+FX",
 "description": "Tone+FX 4.3b: the Tone+FX suite with a STUTTER page beside PERFORM, and ONE WRMZ delay line appended at the end of the chain (GRAINZ removed). Main scroll: FOLD, CRUSH, RING, STEREO, PITCH, TILT, DELAYS. UP opens the PERFORM tree: PERFORM and STUTTER. The 16 trigs on STUTTER freeze and loop the finished master mix at tempo subdivisions. CRUSH has REDUX and CRUNCH (BITS removed). Params are kept per pattern in one reserved MIDI track (channel 16), packed into its pattern block, and respond to MIDI CC. The suite ceiling and meter run last. It REQUIRES the core (core-dn1 4.1) and does not include it.",
 "category": "Sound",
 "author": "Digital Alchemy DSP",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
 "target": {
  "device": "digitone-mk1",
  "product": "Digitone mk1",
  "os": "1.44",
  "syx_sha256": "d4f200d04484333d82822db7744e6484d0def8f2db8ddf55ee2b780cc13c9659",
